  "Personalize Your Theme Color With the Theme Customizer module of eCommerceGo, you have full control over your stores appearance. Start by selecting a theme color that aligns with your brand identity. Whether you prefer bold and vibrant hues or subtle and calming shades, this feature allows you to choose from a wide range of colors to make your store visually appealing and unique. By customizing your theme color, you create a consistent and recognizable brand experience for your customers, enhancing their engagement and loyalty.": "قم بتخصيص لون السمة الخاصة بك باستخدام وحدة تخصيص السمات في eCommerceGo، لديك التحكم الكامل في مظهر متاجرك. ",
