  "Define Your Border Color": "تحديد لون الحدود الخاصة بك",
  "Borders play a crucial role in defining the structure and aesthetics of your stores design. The Theme Customizer module enables you to easily customize border colors to match your chosen theme and enhance the visual hierarchy of your content. This feature allows you to make specific elements stand out or blend seamlessly with the overall design, providing a polished and professional look to your store.": "تلعب الحدود دورًا حاسمًا في تحديد هيكل وجماليات تصميم متاجرك. ",
  "Choose Your Theme White Color": "اختر المظهر الخاص بك باللون الأبيض",
